    145
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planet under Shad Bala scheme, to be declared strong. Now we consider it useful ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    154,
    556,
    169
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "to describe the views of other authorities as to when he should be declared strong ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    178,
    556,
    194
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "on the basis of the five kinds of strength viz. (1) Sthan Bala, (2) Dik Bala, (3) ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    202,
    556,
    218
   ]
  },
  {
