  {
   "text": "24. To ascertain the strength of the Lagna and other house add one Rupa to ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    517,
    556,
    532
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the strength of the lord of the Bhava concerned. Further add to them the Dik Bala ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    541,
    556,
    556
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and Drig Bala of that house. The sum total would be the Bhava Bala required.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    565,
    521,
    581
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Notes: If the Bhava is aspected or associated with its lord, Jupiter. Venus or ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    589,
    556,
    605
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Mercury or be aspected by Jupiter or Mercury, the strength so obtained should also ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    613,
    556,
    629
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be taken into account in determining the strength of a house (See verse 6 of this ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    638,
    556,
    653
   ]
  },
